---
// The "AI" badge (UI-SPEC 5.3, D-06): 13px/600, --on-ai on --ai, 20px tall. It always sits next to
// words that carry the meaning ("Written by an AI model. Not checked by a person."), so it is
// hidden from screen readers rather than read twice; the colour only repeats the words.
---

<span class="ai-badge" aria-hidden="true">AI</span>

<style>
  .ai-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex: none;
    min-height: 20px;
    padding-inline: var(--space-2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xs);
    background: var(--ai);
    color: var(--on-ai);
    font-size: var(--text-footnote);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 20px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
</style>
